# Line endings. Everything follows the repository default (core.autocrlf), except
# Windows command scripts, which cmd.exe can only parse with CRLF line endings:
# an LF-only tools/push.cmd silently turned into a wall of "'xxx' is not recognized
# as an internal or external command" and never actually pushed anything (v0.2.29).
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
